      {
        "author_name": "Linda Jolicoeur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103566569313019059588/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5YTZAIM_VP88WQH_rIb7T74mR6AkKC5gWqdvNpG4cF3vBrj5wZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I can't get in touch with them after leaving my computer at Geek Squat for three days. When I call, the message says the branch is closed... in broad daylight, and I get the same message all day. The online chat wants me to pay for information and enter my credit card details, even though I've been paying $32.50 a month for the past 18 months for technical support and the warranty on my laptop, which I bought from them 18 months ago. It's unbelievable! I'm disappointed with their after-sales service and especially with not being able to work without my laptop and without any news from them.",
        "time": 1764604934,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "José Maltais",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111142255203128295881/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGCUeih1jWJQwo52_zT1mPf2tPSMevPj-txWqWXpiUaIa_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I bought a 3-year warranty on an Oculus headset, they gave me a gift card, and there was no way to buy another one because their prices had gone up. I must be squeaky clean... then they\nasked me to buy another warranty for $160",
        "time": 1665787829,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Olivier Lalonde (NeezyArts)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108672015807126164962/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLxD9q1wa_QCw2GT9TWsyc55rpQi_kIv4HHTfL0VVEHcqU_nA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
